.TH "xor32sum" "1" "2026\-10-30" "TheCRatTime"
.SH NAME
\fBxor32sum\fR \- calculate hash sum of \fIFILE\fR\&.
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBxor32sum \fIFILE \fB...\fR
\fBxor32sum \-\-verify\fR|\fB\-\-check \fISIGNATURE_FILE FILE\fB
\fBxor32sum \-\-version\fR|\fB\-V\fR
\fBxor32sum \-\-help\fR|fB\-h\fR|\fB\-?\fR
.fi
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBxor32sum\fR is a non crypto hash checker, based on Xorshift32 algorithm\&.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
\fB\-\-verify\fR, \fB\-\-check\fR
.RS 4
Check \fIFILE\fR by hash in \fISIGNATURE_FILE\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-V\fR
.RS 4
Show xor32sum version\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR, \fB\-?\fR
.RS 4
Show this help and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
.SH RETURN VALUE
Return value is:
.PP
\fB0\fR
.RS 4
Zero errors, signature correct\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB1\fR
.RS 4
Signature not correct\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB2\fR
.RS 4
Can'\&t open file / allocate memory\&.
.RE
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmd5sum\fR(1), \fBsha256sum\fR(1), \fBsha1sum\fR(1)
